      "questionTextEng": "To restaurant owners, the free drinking water provided to customers is a ____________.\n\n           (1)   free good\n           (2)   producer good\n           (3)   consumer good\n           (4)   private good\n\n           A.    (2) only\n           B.    (1) and (2) only\n           C.    (2) and (4) only\n           D.    (3) and (4) only",
