      "answerEng": "Answer: D\n    Laptop computers and tablet computers are substitutes. When the price of tablet computers decreases,\n    the demand for laptop computers will decrease. The equilibrium position in the laptop computer market\n    will change from A to B.\n    Option A: This will cause the supply of laptop computers to increase, causing the entire supply curve to\n    shift to the right.\n    Option B: This will cause the supply of laptop computers to decrease, causing the entire supply curve to\n    shift to the left.\n    Option C: This will cause the demand for laptop computers to increase, changing the equilibrium\n    position in the laptop computer market from B to A.",
