      "questionTextEng": "Jessica and Cathy are waiters of a restaurant. They are paid at the same hourly rate and receive pay\n                                                           according to the number of hours they work.\n\n                                                          (a)   To which type of production does the restaurant belong? Explain.                                  (2 marks)\n\n                                                          (b) Explain whether Jessica and Cathy necessarily have the same opportunity cost of working as a waiter in\n                                                              the restaurant.\n                                                                                                                                                          (3 marks)\n\n                                                          (c)   Is the expense of hiring Jessica and Cathy a fixed cost or a variable cost to the restaurant? Explain.\n                                                                                                                                                                  (2 marks)\n\n                                                          (d) Give ONE reason to explain why waiters are paid at time rate instead of piece rate.                 (2 marks)",
