      "questionTextEng": "Which of the following statements are normative statements?\n\n      (1) The economic losses caused by network attacks initiated by hackers amounted to billions of dollars.\n      (2) The government should help private enterprises improve cybersecurity.\n      (3) Installing a firewall is the best way to prevent network attacks.\n\n           A.    (1) and (2) only\n           B.    (1) and (3) only\n           C.    (2) and (3) only\n           D.    (1), (2) and (3)",
