      "questionTextEng": "The following table shows the employment distribution of different types of production in an economy:\n\n                                                          2018                        2021\n                       Primary production                  5%                          4%\n                      Secondary production                15%                         11%\n                       Tertiary production                80%                         85%\n\n     Based on the above table, we can conclude that from 2018 to 2021,\n\n           A.    the overall number of employment remained unchanged.\n           B.    the relative importance of primary production in terms of employment decreased.\n           C.    the number of workers engaged in secondary production decreased.\n           D.    the contribution of tertiary production to GDP increased.",
