      "questionTextEng": "The elderly care service sector in Hong Kong faces persistent labour shortages. A 2020 survey showed that there\n      were near 6,000 vacancies in the sector. Which of the following can alleviate the above situation?\n\n       (1) to import more foreign workers\n       (2) to provide subsidies to employees of the elderly care service sector\n       (3) to introduce more machines to replace labour\n\n            A.    (1) and (2) only\n            B.    (1) and (3) only\n            C.    (2) and (3) only\n            D.    (1), (2) and (3)",
