      "questionTextEng": "Suppose a country abolishes the effective quota on good X, and at the same time good X becomes more popular.\n\n      Which of the following statements about the market of good X are CORRECT?\n\n       (1) The price may increase or decrease.\n       (2) The consumer surplus will decrease.\n       (3) Total social surplus will increase.\n\n           A.    (1) and (2) only\n           B.    (1) and (3) only\n           C.    (2) and (3) only\n           D.    (1), (2) and (3)",
