      "questionTextEng": "Refer to the following proposals.\n\n         Proposal (1): raising the standard tax rate of the salaries tax\n         Proposal (2): introducing a progressive rating system for the profits tax\n         Proposal (3): raising the amount of Comprehensive Social Security Assistance Schemes\n\n      Which of the above proposals help reduce the income gap in Hong Kong without raising the price level?\n\n            A.    (1) and (2) only\n            B.    (1) and (3) only\n            C.    (2) and (3) only\n            D.    (1), (2) and (3)",
