      "questionTextEng": "Study the following diagram.\n                              Price level\n                                                 LRAS\n\n                                                                SRAS\n\n                                                       E\n                                                    A\n\n                                                                AD\n\n                                                                         Aggregate output\n                               0                  Y1\n\n      The long run equilibrium point of an economy changes from E to A. Which of the following is a possible reason\n      for the change?\n\n           A.    The government reduces the import tariff.\n           B.    The government distributes cash to citizens.\n           C.    More residents emigrate overseas.\n           D.    The cost of production increases.",
