      "questionTextEng": "The diagram below shows the money demand curve (Md) and money supply curve (Ms) of an economy. The\n      original equilibrium point is at E.\n                         Nominal interest\n                            rate (%)\n                                                Ms\n\n                                                   E\n\n                                                                Md\n\n                             0                                            Quantity of money\n\n      Suppose the government lowers the discount rate and the liquidity of interest-bearing assets increases. The\n      nominal interest rate __________ and the quantity of money __________.\n\n            A.    will increase ... will decrease\n            B.    will increase ... may increase or decrease\n            C.    will decrease ... will increase\n            D.    will decrease ... will decrease",
