      "questionTextEng": "Ms. Cheung is a nurse at a private hospital in Hong Kong. She owns a residential unit in the Mainland and\n      receives rental income from leasing it. Recently, she has purchased a first-hand residential unit in Hong Kong and\n      has since lived in it.\n\n      According to the above information, which type(s) of tax does Ms. Cheung need to pay to the Hong Kong\n      government?\n\n       (1) property tax\n       (2) stamp duty\n       (3) salaries tax\n\n            A.    (3) only\n            B.    (1) and (2) only\n            C.    (2) and (3) only\n            D.    (1), (2) and (3)",
