      "questionTextEng": "Which of the following can best explain why income inequality among private piano teachers tends to be larger\n      than that among security guards?\n\n           A.    The market demand for private piano teachers is larger.\n           B.    The supply of private piano teachers is more elastic.\n           C.    Private piano teachers have a larger difference in natural abilities.\n           D.    The average working hours of private piano teachers are shorter.",
      "answerEng": "Answer: C\n    The difference in natural abilities among private piano teachers tends to be larger than that among\n    security guards. A more gifted private piano teacher can earn much more than the average level.",
