      "questionTextEng": "Miss Li withdraws HK$10,000 from her time deposit account with a licensed bank. She remits HK$3,000\n      overseas. Then she puts the remainder into her current account with the same bank.\n\n      What is the immediate effect of the above actions on the Hong Kong dollar money supply?\n\n           A.    M1, M2 and M3 will decrease by HK$3,000.\n           B.    M1 will increase by HK$7,000, while M2 and M3 will decrease by HK$3,000.\n           C.    M2 will decrease by HK$10,000 and M3 will remain unchanged.\n           D.    Both M2 and M3 will decrease by HK$7,000.",
