      "questionTextEng": "According to the quantity theory of money, when the central bank reduces the required reserve ratio,\n\n             A.   the velocity of circulation of money will decrease.\n             B.   the economy will experience deflation.\n             C.   the real output will increase.\n             D.   the nominal output will increase.",
