      "calculationType": "貿易得益計算",
      "source": "模擬試卷二十九 卷一",
      "reviewedByAI": "Y",
      "lastReviewDate": "2026-09-24",
      "originalQuestionImage": "originals/29/q-p1-42.jpg",
      "originalAnswerImage": "originals/29/a-p1-42.jpg",
      "questionTextEng": "The following table shows the number of man-hours required to produce tomatoes and bananas in Country A and\n      Country B.\n\n                                          1 unit of tomatoes                  1 unit of bananas\n                   Country A                5 man-hours                         15 man-hours\n                   Country B                4 man-hours                         20 man-hours\n\n      Suppose the banana-exporting country exports 1 unit of bananas in exchange for 4 units of tomatoes. At the same\n      time, the banana-exporting country needs to pay 0.5 units of tomatoes in transportation costs per unit of export.\n      What is the total gain for the banana-exporting country from exporting 10 units of bananas?\n\n            A.    5 units of tomatoes\n            B.    10 units of tomatoes\n            C.    15 units of tomatoes\n            D.    20 units of tomatoes",
      "answerEng": "Answer: A\n    Country A’s opportunity cost of producing 1 unit of bananas = 3 (15 / 5) units of tomatoes\n    Country B’s opportunity cost of producing 1 unit of bananas = 5 (20 / 4) units of tomatoes\n    Since the opportunity cost of producing 1 unit of bananas in Country A is lower than that in Country B,\n    Country A has a comparative advantage in producing bananas. It will specialise in the production and\n    export of bananas.\n    Terms of trade: 1 unit of bananas = 4 units of tomatoes\n    Gain for the banana-exporting country (i.e. Country A) per unit of export = 4 units of tomatoes  3 units\n    of tomatoes  0.5 units of tomatoes (transportation costs) = 0.5 units of tomatoes\n    Total gain for Country A from exporting 10 units of bananas = 0.5 units of tomatoes × 10 = 5 units of\n    tomatoes",
      "originalAnswerImageEng": "originals/29/ae-p1-42.jpg",
      "originalQuestionImageEng": "originals/29/qe-p1-42.jpg",
      "stemPatterns": [
        "(比較優勢表格) 計算(某國)出口(某數量)的總得益"
      ]
