      "questionTextEng": "The following table shows the change in the exchange rate between the US dollar (USD) and the Japanese yen\n      (JPY).\n\n                                   Year X                  Exchange rate\n                                   January              USD 1 = JPY 106.3\n                                  December              USD 1 = JPY 112.6\n\n      Katie exchanged USD 2,000 for JPY in January. Then she sold the sum for USD in December.\n\n      In the above transactions, Katie _____________.\n\n           A.    lost about USD 112\n           B.    lost about USD 318\n           C.    gained about USD 112\n           D.    gained about USD 318\n\n                                               EN D O F PAP E R",
