      "questionTextEng": "The book retailing market in Country A is a monopoly. The book retailer adopts uniform pricing. Figure 1\n                                                             shows its demand curve and marginal cost curve.\n\n                                                                                                     Figure 1\n\n                                                                                   Unit price\n                                                                                                                                        MC: Marginal cost\n                                                                                                                            MC\n                                                                                                                                        D: Demand\n\n                                                                                                                        D\n                                                                                                                                  Quantity\n                                                                                     0\n\n                                                           (a)   Indicate the marginal revenue curve (MR), the profit-maximising output level (QM) and the price (PM) of\n                                                                 the book retailer in Figure 1.                                                               (3 marks)\n\n                                                           (b) Later, the government open up the book retailing market. Many firms enter the market, and it becomes\n                                                               perfectly competitive.\n\n                                                                 (i)   Indicate the new profit-maximising output level (QC) and the price (PC) in Figure 1.      (2 marks)\n\n                                                                 (ii) With the aid of Figure 1, explain how such a change in the market structure can improve economic\n                                                                      efficiency.                                                                             (4 marks)\n\n                                                           (c)   A book retailer offers a student discount. All students with valid student identification documents can\n                                                                 purchase designated books at 30% off the original price. Explain whether this price arrangement\n                                                                 constitutes price discrimination.                                                             (3 marks)\n\n                                                           (d) It has been reported that several book retailers in the market have agreed to charge the same price for the\n                                                               books they sell.\n\n                                                                 (i)   What kind of anti-competitive behaviour is described in the above practice? List ONE possible\n                                                                       motive for it.                                                                      (2 marks)\n\n                                                                 (ii) If the above case happened in Hong Kong, which conduct rule of the Competition Ordinance would\n                                                                      the book retailers violate? Explain.                                                  (2 marks)",
