      "questionTextEng": "In August 2022, the government installed a floating photovoltaic system mock-up (浮式太陽能發電模擬系統) at\n      Shing Mun River in Sha Tin, as part of the pilot trial of the system. It is expected that more photovoltaic panels\n      will be installed in 2023. The electricity generated will mainly be used by nearby government facilities.\n\n      In the above case, the sunlight in the production of solar energy belongs to ___________ because\n      _________________.\n\n            A.    capital ... the amount of sunlight cannot be increased by human efforts\n            B.    capital ... cost is involved in using sunlight\n            C.    land ... it is a natural resource endowed by nature\n            D.    land ... the sunlight collected by human effort becomes a man-made resource used in the production\n                  process",
