      "questionTextEng": "The demand for ___________ can be regarded as a derived demand for ____________.\n\n            A.    bread ... flour\n            B.    public healthcare services ... private healthcare services\n            C.    hair stylists ... hairdressing services\n            D.    mobile network services ... smartphones",
