      "questionTextEng": "The figure below shows the sales data of different brands of smartphones in Country A in 2022.\n\n                                   5\n                                 4.5\n                                   4\n                                 3.5\n                 (10 thousand)\n\n                                   3\n                                 2.5\n                                   2\n                                 1.5\n                                   1\n                                 0.5\n                                   0\n                                           Brand A       Brand B            Brand C   Brand D       Others\n\n      Based on the above information, we can conclude that the market structure of smartphones in Country A in 2022\n      can be regarded as ______________ because ________________.\n\n           A.    oligopoly … different smartphone brands engaged in non-price competition\n           B.    oligopoly ... several dominant sellers controlled the smartphone market in Country A\n           C.    monopolistic competition ... smartphones produced by different brands were heterogeneous products\n           D.    monopolistic competition ... the smartphone sellers were interdependent in their marketing strategies",
