      "answerEng": "Answer: A\n    After the imposition of the quota of 2 units, the market price will be $9.\n    Consumer surplus after the quota is imposed = ($10 – $9) + ($9 – $9) = $1\n    Producer surplus after the quota is imposed = ($9 – $4) + ($9 – $5) = $9",
