      "questionTextEng": "In Hong Kong, people can buy and sell properties with the assistance of estate agents. The chart below\n                                                           shows the change in the number of estate agent’s licences held by individuals in Hong Kong:\n                                                                                                         Figure 1\n\n                                                          (a)   Explain which type of production estate agents engage in.                                    (2 marks)\n\n                                                          (b) Many estate agency companies pay their estate agents a basic salary plus commission. Explain ONE\n                                                              advantage of this wage payment method over a fixed monthly salary from the viewpoint of the estate\n                                                              agency companies.                                                                        (2 marks)\n\n                                                          (c)   Give ONE demand-side factor to explain the change in the number of estate agent’s licences held by\n                                                                individuals in Hong Kong in Figure 1.                                                    (2 marks)\n\n                                                          (d) Some estate agency companies suggest that the government waive the application fees for estate agents\n                                                              to obtain licenses. Explain how this would affect the mobility of labour.                  (3 marks)",
