      "questionTextEng": "During the Lunar New Year period, some restaurants are closed while some restaurants remain open.\n\n                                                          (a)   Give ONE example of variable cost incurred in restaurants that remain open during Lunar New Year.\n                                                                                                                                                            (1 mark)\n\n                                                          (b) Explain how the closure of some restaurants during the Lunar New Year period would affect the price\n                                                              elasticity of demand for restaurant services.                                               (2 marks)\n\n                                                          (c)   Some restaurants that remain open raise their menu prices during the Lunar New Year period. Explain\n                                                                which basic economic problem this arrangement is related to.                              (2 marks)\n\n                                                          (d) With the aid of a diagram, explain how the quantity transacted of restaurant services provided by the\n                                                              restaurants that remain open during the Lunar New Year period would change.                 (4 marks)",
