      "questionTextEng": "Mr. Lee is the owner of a coffee shop. He bought various coffee brewing tools for the shop and was responsible\n     for all duties in the shop, including taking orders from customers, making coffee, operating the cash register, etc.\n     Recently, he has hired an employee to assist with serving customers and cashier duties, while he specialises in\n     making coffee.\n\n     Which of the following statements are CORRECT?\n\n           (1)   Mr. Lee can save on production tools purchased for the coffee shop.\n           (2)   Mr. Lee can save the time spent on switching tasks.\n           (3)   Mr. Lee’s income includes profit and interest.\n\n           A.    (1) and (2) only\n           B.    (1) and (3) only\n           C.    (2) and (3) only\n           D.    (1), (2) and (3)",
