      "inlineDiagrams": "diagrams/MT31-P1-15-1.jpg,diagrams/MT31-P1-15-2.jpg",
      "answerEng": "Answer: C\n    Private cars with an internal combustion engine and electric private cars are substitutes. Under the\n    government’s scheme, more people will switch to the electric car to replace their private car with an\n    internal combustion engine. Therefore, the demand for electric cars will increase.\n    The demand for and supply of private cars with an internal combustion engine will decrease.",
      "questionTextEng": "The government implements a ‘One-for-One Replacement’ scheme from 28 February 2018 to 31 March 2024.\n      Under the scheme, eligible private car owners can arrange to scrap and de-register their own old private car\n      (private car with an internal combustion engine or electric private car) and then first register a new electric private\n      car under their own name. The owners can enjoy a higher first registration tax concession. Which of the following\n      represents the above situation?\n\n         A.                                                        B.\n                      Private cars with an internal                              Private cars with an internal\n                          combustion engine                                          combustion engine\n              Unit price                                                Unit price\n\n                                           S1\n                                                  S2                                            S\n\n                                                   D1\n                                             D2                                                          D2\n                                                                                                 D1\n                   0                                    Quantity         0                                    Quantity\n\n         C.                                                        D.\n                           Electric private cars                                 Electric private cars\n              Unit price                                                Unit price\n\n                                         S                                                       S1\n                                                                                                      S2\n\n                                                   D2                                                    D1\n                                             D1                                                  D2\n\n                   0                                    Quantity         0                                    Quantity",
