      "questionTextEng": "LOOK Media is the only TV station providing paid television programme service in Country A. Figure 1\n                                                             shows its demand curve and marginal cost curve.\n\n                                                                                                  Figure 1\n                                                                               Unit price\n\n                                                                                                                   MC\n\n                                                                                                                      D\n                                                                                                                            Quantity\n\n                                                                                 0\n\n                                                           (a)   Suppose LOOK Media adopts simple monopoly pricing. Indicate the profit-maximising output level and\n                                                                 price as Q1 and P1 respectively in Figure 1. Explain why such a pricing arrangement would lead to a\n                                                                 deadweight loss with the aid of Figure 1.                                                (5 marks)\n\n                                                           (b) The TV station begins using digital cameras, and the marginal cost of producing television programmes\n                                                               is reduced.\n\n                                                                 (i)   Indicate the new output level and price as Q2 and P2 respectively in Figure 1.            (2 marks)\n\n                                                                 (ii) Indicate the new deadweight loss in Figure 1.                                               (1 mark)\n\n                                                           (c)   LOOK Media provides a half-price plan to families with seniors aged 65 and above.\n\n                                                                 (i)   Explain whether this price arrangement constitutes price discrimination.                  (3 marks)\n\n                                                                 (ii) Suggest TWO conditions for practising this price discrimination.                           (2 marks)\n\n                                                           (d) After LOOK Media updates their system, new users are required to subscribe to their music streaming\n                                                               platform at the same time. Name the anti-competitive behaviour LOOK Media is engaged in. State\n                                                               TWO ways such behaviour may harm consumers.                                               (3 marks)",
