      "questionTextEng": "Suppose people’s confidence in electronic wallets weakens due to an increase in potential security risks. Which of\n      the following diagrams best illustrates the effect of the above event on the money market?\n\n                                                                                       Mt = Transaction demand for money\n                                                                                       Ma = Asset demand for money\n       A.                                                   B.\n              Nominal                                              Nominal\n            interest rate                                        interest rate\n                             Mt                                                  Mt0        Mt1\n\n                                                   Quantity of                                        Quantity of\n               0                                   money            0                                 money\n\n      C.                                                     D. Nominal\n             Nominal\n           interest rate                                         interest rate\n\n                                             Ma1                                             Ma\n                                      Ma0          Quantity of                                       Quantity of\n               0                                                    0                                money\n                                                   money",
