      "questionTextEng": "The following table shows the output per unit of resources in Country A and Country B.\n\n                                       Apples (units)                               Bread (units)\n                      Country A               40                  OR                     60\n                      Country B               25                  OR                     45\n\n      Suppose there is no transportation cost. According to the above table, which of the following statements are\n      CORRECT?\n\n            (1)   Country A has both absolute advantage and comparative advantage in producing apples.\n            (2)   A mutually beneficial terms of trade can be 1 unit of apples = 1.6 units of bread.\n            (3)   If Country A exports 20 units of apples to Country B in exchange for 35 units of bread, Country A’s\n                  total gain from trade is 5 units of bread.\n\n            A.    (1) and (2) only\n            B.    (1) and (3) only\n            C.    (2) and (3) only\n            D.    (1), (2) and (3)",
      "answerEng": "Answer: D\n     (1) is correct. Country A can produce more apples than Country B with the same amount of resources,\n    so Country A has an absolute advantage in producing apples.\n    Country A’s opportunity cost of producing 1 unit of apples = 1.5 (= 60/40) units of bread\n    Country B’s opportunity cost of producing 1 unit of apples = 1.8 (= 45/25) units of bread\n    As Country A has a lower opportunity cost in producing apples, Country A has a comparative advantage\n    in producing apples.\n    (2) is correct. As the terms of trade lies between the opportunity costs of producing apples for the two\n    countries, it is a mutually beneficial terms of trade.\n    (3) is correct. Terms of trade: 1 unit of apples = 1.75 units of bread\n    Country A’s gain from trade per unit of apples exported = 0.25 (= 1.75 – 1.5) units of bread\n    Country A’s total gain from trade for exporting 20 units of apples = 5 (= 0.25 × 20) units of bread",
      "originalAnswerImageEng": "originals/32/ae-p1-42.jpg",
      "originalQuestionImageEng": "originals/32/qe-p1-42.jpg",
      "stemPatterns": [
        "(兩國產出表) 根據上表，下列哪些 (絕對/比較優勢/貿易) 陳述是正確的？"
      ]
