      "questionTextEng": "With the advancement of communications technology, more and more companies are allowing their\n                                                           employees to work from home.\n\n                                                           (a)   An employee replies to customers’ emails from his home computer. Explain which factor of production\n                                                                 the computer belongs to.                                                                  (2 marks)\n\n                                                           (b) A company decides to allow more employees to work from home in order to reduce the size of the\n                                                               office and save rental costs. Explain to what basic economic problem the company’s decision is related.\n                                                                                                                                                            (2 marks)\n\n                                                           (c)   As more companies allow their employees to work from home, the rents of commercial buildings\n                                                                 decrease. However, the vacancy rate still increases. With the aid of Figure 1, explain the above\n                                                                 phenomenon.                                                                             (5 marks)\n\n                                                                                        Figure 1: Leasing market for offices\n\n                                                                          Rent\n\n                                                                                                                          S0\n\n                                                                                                                               D0\n                                                                          0                                                           Quantity\n\n                                                           (d) Suppose some banks decide to hold more excess reserves as they are worried that the high vacancy rate\n                                                               of commercial buildings will affect the solvency of developers. Explain how this will affect the deposit\n                                                               creation ability of the banking system in the economy.                                        (2 marks)",
