      "questionTextEng": "FoodCat is the only online food delivery platform in Country A. Figure 2 shows its demand curve and\n                                                             marginal cost curve.\n\n                                                                                                      Figure 2\n                                                                                    Unit price\n\n                                                                                                                    MC\n\n                                                                                                                   D\n                                                                                                                                  Quantity\n\n                                                                                      0\n\n                                                           (a)   Suppose FoodCat adopts simple monopoly pricing. Indicate the profit-maximising output and price as Q1\n                                                                 and P1 respectively in Figure 2 and explain how FoodCat determines its profit-maximising output and\n                                                                 price.                                                                                     (4 marks)\n\n                                                           (b) Demand for food delivery services increases as more people work from home.\n\n                                                                 (i)   How would an increase in demand for food delivery services affect FoodCat’s marginal revenue?\n                                                                                                                                                               (1 mark)\n\n                                                                 (ii) Suppose FoodCat produces the same quantity after the increase in demand. With the aid of\n                                                                      Figure 2, explain whether economic efficiency will be affected.                         (3 marks)\n\n                                                           (c)   FoodCat offers a 20% discount to new customers. Explain whether this price arrangement constitutes\n                                                                 price discrimination.                                                                   (3 marks)\n\n                                                           (d) Suppose there are other companies planning to join the food delivery market. FoodCat requires\n                                                               restaurants collaborating with it not to cooperate with other online food delivery platforms.\n\n                                                                 (i)   Name the anti-competitive behaviour FoodCat is engaged in. List TWO possible motives for\n                                                                       FoodCat to engage in such behaviour.                                          (3 marks)\n\n                                                                 (ii) Which conduct rule of the Competition Ordinance might FoodCat have violated if the above case\n                                                                      happened in Hong Kong? Explain.                                                     (2 marks)",
