      "questionTextEng": "The following shows the holiday decorations of a shopping mall in Hong Kong.\n\n     Many people like to take photos in front of the decorations. To the shopping mall, the decorations are _________.\n\n           (1)   producer goods\n           (2)   consumer goods\n           (3)   free goods\n           (4)   public goods\n\n           A.    (1) and (3) only\n           B.    (1) and (4) only\n           C.    (2) and (3) only\n           D.    (2) and (4) only",
