      "graphType": "-",
      "tableType": "投入產出表",
      "multipleSelectionType": "-",
      "calculationType": "-",
      "source": "模擬試卷三十三 卷一",
      "reviewedByAI": "Y",
      "lastReviewDate": "2026-09-24",
      "originalQuestionImage": "originals/33/q-p1-08.jpg",
      "originalAnswerImage": "originals/33/a-p1-08.jpg",
      "questionTextEng": "Firm A           Firm B\n                  Number of workers                                          10               12\n                  Number of working hours per worker per day                 8.5               8\n                  Quantity of output per day                                850              1,000\n                  Percentage of output with quality up to standard          95%              70%\n\n     With reference to the above table, which of the following can best explain the difference in quality of the outputs\n     between firm A and firm B?\n\n           A.    The working environment of firm A is worse than that of firm B.\n           B.    Firm A practices a lower degree of division of labour than firm B.\n           C.    Firm A uses more producer goods than firm B.\n           D.    Firm A uses time rate while firm B uses piece rate.",
      "answerEng": "Answer: D\n     Average labour productivity of firm A = 850 units / (10 × 8.5) man-hours = 10 units/man-hour\n     Average labour productivity of firm B = 1,000 units / (12 × 8) man-hours = 10.42 units/man-hour\n     Compared with firm B, firm A has a lower average labour productivity and a higher percentage of\n     output with quality up to standard. This means that the workers of firm A may be paid by time rate and\n     do not need to rush for more output at the expense of quality. On the other hand, the average labour\n     productivity of firm B is higher, but the percentage of output with quality up to standard is lower. This\n     means that the workers of firm B may be paid by piece rate and they rush for more output at the expense\n     of quality.",
      "originalAnswerImageEng": "originals/33/ae-p1-08.jpg",
      "originalQuestionImageEng": "originals/33/qe-p1-08.jpg",
      "stemPatterns": [
        "(兩廠商表) 下列哪項最能解釋 (某指標) 的差別？"
      ]
