      "questionTextEng": "Some insurance companies pay their insurance agents a basic salary plus commission. From the viewpoint of\n      insurance agents, which of the following is/are (an) advantage(s) of the above arrangement instead of paying\n      commission only?\n\n            (1)   The income of insurance agents will be more stable.\n            (2)   The cost of monitoring the service quality of insurance agents will be lower.\n            (3)   Insurance agents can increase their income by improving performance.\n\n            A.    (1) only\n            B.    (2) only\n            C.    (1) and (3) only\n            D.    (2) and (3) only",
