      "questionTextEng": "The Labour Department has launched the ‘Work Orientation and Placement Scheme’. An allowance will be\n      granted to employers who hire persons with disabilities under the scheme and provide appropriate\n      training/support and appoint a mentor for such employees, as well as comply with other requirements of the\n      scheme. Which of the following statements about the scheme are CORRECT?\n\n            (1)    The scheme helps equalise opportunities.\n            (2)    The scheme helps reduce income inequality.\n            (3)    The scheme raises labour productivity.\n\n            A.     (1) and (2) only\n            B.     (1) and (3) only\n            C.     (2) and (3) only\n            D.     (1), (2) and (3)\n\n                                                  EN D O F PAP E R",
