      "originalAnswerImage": "originals/33/a-p2-04.jpg",
      "questionTextEng": "Currently, many government services in Hong Kong are charged below cost. To relieve pressure on public\n                                                           finances, some people propose that the government should adjust various government fees, including fees\n                                                           for government services related to people’s livelihood, such as the recreational and sports facilities of the\n                                                           Leisure and Cultural Services Department. Discuss the proposal to increase fees for the recreational and\n                                                           sports facilities by giving ONE argument FOR and ONE argument AGAINST it.                              (4 marks)",
