      "questionTextEng": "To encourage the public to use private medical services, the government provides a per-unit subsidy to\n                                                           private medical service providers.\n\n                                                           Under what condition will consumers enjoy a larger share of the subsidy than producers? Explain your\n                                                           answer with the aid of a diagram.                                                                (7 marks)\n\n                                                     Section B (40 marks)",
