      "questionTextEng": "Read the following news report.\n\n                                                           In May 2023, the food delivery platform Meituan (美團) launched food delivery brand ‘KeeTa’ in Hong\n                                                           Kong, which competes with Deliveroo and Foodpanda in the food delivery services market in Hong\n                                                           Kong.\n\n                                                          (a)   Give ONE variable cost involved in a food delivery platform providing food delivery services. (1 mark)\n\n                                                          (b) Give TWO reasons to explain why the Hong Kong food delivery market is NOT perfectly competitive.\n                                                                                                                                                     (4 marks)\n\n                                                          (c)   Food delivery platforms sometimes offer free delivery as a promotion. Using the law of demand,\n                                                                explain how this would affect the proportion of lower-priced orders to higher-priced orders. (4 marks)",
