      "marks": 1,
      "section": "-",
      "questionNumber": "21",
      "questionTextChi": "參閱以下甲國某政黨提出的建議。\n建議(1)︰增加向低收入人士提供的轉移支付\n建議(2)︰調高薪俸稅的個人免稅額\n建議(3)︰提高垃圾收費的金額\n以上哪(幾)項建議會降低甲國按住戶可支配收入計算的堅尼系數？\nA.\t只有 (1)\nB.\t只有 (2)\nC.\t只有 (3)\nD.\t只有 (1)、(2)",
      "plainText": "參閱以下甲國某政黨提出的建議。\n建議(1)︰增加向低收入人士提供的轉移支付\n建議(2)︰調高薪俸稅的個人免稅額\n建議(3)︰提高垃圾收費的金額\n以上哪(幾)項建議會降低甲國按住戶可支配收入計算的堅尼系數？\nA.\t只有 (1)\nB.\t只有 (2)\nC.\t只有 (3)\nD.\t只有 (1)、(2)",
      "topic": "效率、公平和政府的角色 (II)",
      "question": "MT34-P1-21",
      "answerMC": "D",
      "answerChi": "答案︰D\n(1)是正確的。受助人的可支配收入會增加，而受助人主要為低收入人士，貧富之間的收入差距會縮窄，按可支配收入計算的堅尼系數會下降。\n(2)是正確的。調高薪俸稅的個人免稅額會令需要繳納薪俸稅的低收入人士減少，貧富之間的收入差距會縮窄，按可支配收入計算的堅尼系數會下降。\n(3)是不正確的。垃圾收費屬累退性質，由於相對於高收入階層，同等金額的費用增加佔低收入階層的收入比重較大。提高垃圾收費的金額會導致貧富之間的收入差距擴大，按可支配收入計算的堅尼系數會上升。",
      "curriculumClassification": [
        "E 效率、公平和政府的角色"
      ],
      "AristochapterClassification": [
        "Ch14"
      ],
      "concepts": [
        "收入不均"
      ],
      "patterns": [
        "複選組合"
      ],
      "graphType": "-",
      "tableType": "-",
      "multipleSelectionType": "三項陳述組合",
      "calculationType": "-",
      "source": "模擬試卷三十四 卷一",
      "reviewedByAI": "Y",
      "lastReviewDate": "2026-09-24",
      "originalQuestionImage": "originals/34/q-p1-21.jpg",
      "originalAnswerImage": "originals/34/a-p1-21.jpg",
      "questionTextEng": "Refer to the following proposals in Country A.\n\n         Proposal (1): increasing transfer payments to low-income people\n         Proposal (2): increasing the basic allowance for salaries tax\n         Proposal (3): increasing the amount of municipal solid waste charging\n\n      Which of the above proposals will reduce Country A’s Gini coefficient based on household disposable income?\n\n           A.    (1) only\n           B.    (2) only\n           C.    (3) only\n           D.    (1) and (2) only",
      "answerEng": "Answer: D\n    (1) is correct. The disposable income of the recipients will increase. As the recipients are mainly\n    low-income people, the income gap between the rich and the poor will narrow. The Gini coefficient\n    based on household disposable income will decrease.\n    (2) is correct. Increasing the basic allowance for the salaries tax will reduce the number of low-income\n    people who need to pay salaries tax. The income gap between the rich and the poor will narrow. The\n    Gini coefficient based on household disposable income will decrease.\n    (3) is incorrect. Municipal solid waste charging is a regressive tax because the same amount of charging\n    increase accounts for a larger proportion of the income of the low-income group than that of the\n    high-income group. Increasing the amount of municipal solid waste charging will widen the income gap\n    between the rich and the poor. The Gini coefficient based on household disposable income will increase.",
