      "answerEng": "Answer: B\n    Withdrawing HK$500,000 from an account in a restricted license bank will cause M1 and M2 to\n    increase by HK$500,000 without affecting M3.\n    Holding HK$100,000 as cash will not affect M1, M2 and M3.\n    Depositing HK$200,000 into a time deposit account in a licensed bank will cause M1 to decrease by\n    HK$200,000 without affecting M2 and M3.\n    Remitting the remainder of HK$200,000 overseas will cause M1, M2 and M3 to decrease by\n    HK$200,000.\n    In conclusion, M1 will increase by HK$100,000, M2 will increase by HK$300,000, and M3 will\n    decrease by HK$200,000.",
