      "questionTextEng": "Mr. Chan is a renovation worker. Recently, he has borrowed $30,000 from his friend, Miss Wong, to\n                                                           purchase renovation tools. Mr. Chan has promised to return the money to Miss Wong one month later and\n                                                           would also install a new light for her home.\n\n                                                           (a)   Explain why the light and the installation service provided by Mr. Chan could be regarded as ‘interest’\n                                                                 to Mr. Chan.                                                                                 (2 marks)\n\n                                                           (b)   Suppose Miss Wong does not like the light. Explain whether Mr. Chan’s opportunity cost of installing\n                                                                 a new light for Miss Wong’s home will change.                                              (2 marks)",
