      "questionTextEng": "Refer to the following information about two firms. The two firms produce the same good.\n\n                                                                                                                           Firm A            Firm B\n                                                                    Quantity of output per day (units)                          900           975\n                                                                    Number of workers                                           15             10\n                                                                    Number of working hours per worker per day                   6             6.5\n                                                                    Percentage of output with quality up to standard        95%               80%\n\n                                                           (a)   Explain which firm has a higher average labour productivity.                                (3 marks)\n\n                                                           (b)   Based on the above information, compared with firm B, explain why firm A is more likely to pay its\n                                                                 workers at time rate.                                                                     (2 marks)\n\n                                                           (c)   Apart from the reason about the wage payment method, suggest TWO possible reasons for the\n                                                                 difference in average labour productivity between the two firms.                       (2 marks)",
