      "questionTextEng": "The British Government announced that from April 2024, the minimum wage level for employees aged 21\n                                                           and above will be raised from the current £10.42 per hour to £11.44 per hour.\n\n                                                           (a)   ‘Raising the minimum wage level will reduce the competitiveness of companies in Britain.’ Explain\n                                                                 whether this is a positive statement.                                                      (2 marks)\n\n                                                           (b)   Suppose cleaners in Britain receive the minimum wage. ‘Raising the effective minimum wage level\n                                                                 will not necessarily increase the total wage earnings of cleaners in Britain.’ With the aid of a diagram,\n                                                                 justify this statement.                                                                          (7 marks)",
