      "questionTextEng": "Refer to the following data of an economy.\n\n                                                                                            Year               Consumer Price Index (CPI)\n                                                                                            2021                           108\n                                                                                            2022                           102\n\n                                                           (a)   Calculate the inflation rate in 2022.                                                       (1 mark)\n\n                                                           (b)   Explain ONE difference between using the CPI and Gross Domestic Product (GDP) deflator to\n                                                                 measure the change in the price level.                                                 (2 marks)\n\n                                                           (c)   ‘The above change in the consumer price index will occur if the money supply is growing slower than\n                                                                 the amount of goods and services produced.’ Explain this statement with reference to the quantity\n                                                                 theory of money.                                                                            (4 marks)",
