      "questionTextEng": "Refer to the following information of an economy in a certain year.\n\n                                                                                                                                         $ million\n                                                                      Current account\n                                                                           Visible trade balance                                            100\n                                                                           Invisible trade balance                                          ‒20\n                                                                           Net factor income from abroad                                    55\n                                                                           Net current transfers                                            ‒50\n                                                                      Capital and financial account\n                                                                          Balance of capital and financial account (excluding              ‒120\n                                                                          changes in reserve assets)\n\n                                                          (a)   Explain whether the current account is in deficit or surplus.                                (2 marks)\n\n                                                          (b) Explain whether the balance of payments is in surplus or deficit. Calculate the change in reserve assets.\n                                                                                                                                                              (3 marks)\n\n                                                                                                     END OF SECTION A\n\n                                                     Section B (60 marks)",
