      "questionTextEng": "Jonathan is a swimming coach. He is considering whether to set up his swimming centre in the form of a\n     partnership or a private limited company. Which of the following are possible reasons for him to choose to form a\n     private limited company?\n\n             (1)     A partnership is not a legal entity whereas a private limited company is a legal entity.\n             (2)     Ownership of a private limited company can be freely transferred while that of a partnership cannot.\n             (3)     Compared to a partnership, a private limited company has wider sources of capital.\n\n             A.      (1) and (2) only\n             B.      (1) and (3) only\n             C.      (2) and (3) only\n             D.      (1), (2) and (3)",
