      "questionTextEng": "The input-output relationship of two firms is as follows:\n\n                                                                    Firm A            Firm B\n                 Number of workers                                    40                50\n                 Number of working hours per worker per day           10                 7\n                 Quantity of output (units)                          4,000             4,200\n\n     Based on the above information, _________ has a larger labour supply and _________ has higher average labour\n     productivity.\n\n           A.    firm A ... firm A\n           B.    firm A ... firm B\n           C.    firm B ... firm A\n           D.    firm B ... firm B",
