      "questionTextEng": "When good X and good Y are in ___________, an increase in the demand for good X will result in a decrease in\n      the ___________ good Y.\n\n           A.    joint supply ... price of\n           B.    joint supply ... quantity demanded of\n           C.    competitive supply ... demand for\n           D.    competitive supply ... price of",
      "answerEng": "Answer: A\n    An increase in the demand for good X will lead to an increase in the price of good X.\n    When good X and good Y are in joint supply, an increase in the price of good X will lead to an increase\n    in the supply of good Y. The price of good Y will decrease and the quantity demanded will increase.\n    Options C and D are incorrect. When good X and good Y are in competitive supply, an increase in the\n    price of good X will lead to a decrease in the supply of good Y. The price of good Y will increase and\n    the quantity demanded will decrease.",
