      "questionTextEng": "Mr. Hung runs a hotpot restaurant and has several employees. To save time on training, he assigns each\n                                                           employee a specific task, such as handling ingredients, serving customers, cleaning, etc.\n\n                                                           (a)   (i)   Explain which type of division of labour Mr. Hung has adopted in his restaurant.     (2 marks)\n\n                                                                 (ii) Suggest TWO possible advantages of practising division of labour.                     (2 marks)\n\n                                                           (b)   Suggest ONE example of a variable factor involved in Mr. Hung’s restaurant.                 (1 mark)\n\n                                                           (c)   The following is a job advertisement for Mr. Hung’s restaurant.\n\n                                                                                           Night shift part-time waiter\n\n                                                                       Working hours: Every Friday, Saturday and Sunday, 6 pm to 11 pm\n                                                                       Pay: $60 per hour\n\n                                                                 From the viewpoint of Mr. Hung, explain ONE advantage and ONE disadvantage of using the above\n                                                                 wage payment method over piece rate.                                                 (4 marks)\n\n                                                     .",
