      "questionTextEng": "The following are facilities and services that can be found at Hong Kong International Airport.\n\n           (1)   public restrooms\n           (2)   flight information\n           (3)   security services\n           (4)   paid luggage storage service provided by the airport\n\n     Which of the above items are public goods?\n\n           A.    (1) and (2) only\n           B.    (1) and (4) only\n           C.    (2) and (3) only\n           D.    (3) and (4) only",
