      "questionTextEng": "As more technology enterprises in Silicon Valley in the United States invest in the development of artificial\n     intelligence, more university graduates may go there to look for job opportunities. In this case, these technology\n     enterprises will\n\n            A.    enjoy external economies of scale.\n            B.    suffer from external diseconomies of scale.\n            C.    enjoy internal economies of scale.\n            D.    suffer from internal diseconomies of scale.",
      "answerEng": "Answer: A\n     With more university graduates going to Silicon Valley to look for jobs, the average/marginal cost of\n     hiring the workers they need decreases. The long run average cost of the technology enterprises will\n     decrease, indicating that external economies of scale occur in the industry.",
