      "questionTextEng": "The following diagram shows the relationship between money supply M1 and M2 in Hong Kong.\n\n                                                        M2\n\n                        = Negotiable certificates of deposit issued by licensed banks held outside\n                        the banking sector + Y\n\n                                                 M1\n                         = Currency held by the public + X\n\n    In the above diagram, the components X and Y are _____________ and _____________ respectively.\n\n            A.    reserves with licensed banks ... all customers’ deposits with licensed banks\n            B.    customers’ demand deposits with licensed banks ... customers’ savings deposits with licensed banks\n            C.    customers’ demand deposits with licensed banks ... customers’ savings and time deposits with\n                  licensed banks\n            D.    all customers’ deposits with licensed banks ... all customers’ deposits with restricted licence banks",
