      "questionTextEng": "Which of the following statements about Hong Kong International Airport are positive statements?\n\n           (1)   The passenger volume of Hong Kong International Airport increased by 52.8% in the first half of\n                 2024 compared with the same period the year before.\n           (2)   Hong Kong International Airport should further expand to cope with higher passenger demand in the\n                 future.\n           (3)   Hong Kong International Airport was voted ‘Asia’s Leading Airport 2023’ in the 30th World Travel\n                 Awards.\n           (4)   Hong Kong International Airport is more beautiful than Narita International Airport in Japan.\n\n           A.    (1) and (2) only\n           B.    (1) and (3) only\n           C.    (2) and (4) only\n           D.    (3) and (4) only",
