      "marks": 1,
      "section": "-",
      "questionNumber": "24",
      "questionTextChi": "參閱以下甲國某年的本地生產總值資料。\n組成部分\n百萬元\n私人消費支出\n500\n政府消費支出\n500\n本地固定資本形成淨額\n220\n存貨改變\n−10\n總出口\n280\n物品進口\n100\n服務進口\n60\n間接稅\nX\n直接稅\n30\n補貼\n50\n折舊\n80\n若甲國以要素成本計算的本地生產總值是1,400百萬元，X的值是 ____________。\nA.\t30\nB.\t40\nC.\t60\nD.\t80",
      "plainText": "參閱以下甲國某年的本地生產總值資料。\n組成部分\n百萬元\n私人消費支出\n500\n政府消費支出\n500\n本地固定資本形成淨額\n220\n存貨改變\n−10\n總出口\n280\n物品進口\n100\n服務進口\n60\n間接稅\nX\n直接稅\n30\n補貼\n50\n折舊\n80\n若甲國以要素成本計算的本地生產總值是1,400百萬元，X的值是 ____________。\nA.\t30\nB.\t40\nC.\t60\nD.\t80",
      "topic": "經濟表現的量度 (I)",
      "question": "MT37-P1-24",
      "answerMC": "C",
      "answerChi": "答案：C\n以要素成本計算的本地生產總值 = 私人消費支出 + 投資總額 + 政府消費支出 + 淨出口 – 間接稅 + 津貼\n1,400 = 500 + (220 + 80 – 10) + 500 + (280 – 100 – 60) – X + 50\nX = 60",
      "curriculumClassification": [
        "F 經濟表現的量度"
      ],
      "AristochapterClassification": [
        "Ch15"
      ],
      "concepts": [
        "本地生產總值"
      ],
      "patterns": [
        "填空",
        "計算"
      ],
      "graphType": "-",
      "tableType": "-",
      "multipleSelectionType": "-",
      "calculationType": "本地生產總值計算",
      "source": "模擬試卷三十七 卷一",
      "reviewedByAI": "Y",
      "lastReviewDate": "2026-09-24",
      "originalQuestionImage": "originals/37/q-p1-24.jpg",
      "originalAnswerImage": "originals/37/a-p1-24.jpg",
      "questionTextEng": "Consider the following gross domestic product (GDP) data for Country A.\n\n                                              Components                             $ million\n                        Private consumption expenditure                                500\n                        Government consumption expenditure                             500\n                        Net domestic fixed capital formation                           220\n                        Changes in inventories                                         −10\n                        Total exports                                                  280\n                        Imports of goods                                               100\n                        Imports of services                                             60\n                        Indirect taxes                                                  X\n                        Direct taxes                                                    30\n                        Subsidies                                                       50\n                        Depreciation                                                    80\n\n      If Country A’s GDP at factor cost is $1,400 million, the value of X is ____________.\n\n           A.    30\n           B.    40\n           C.    60\n           D.    80",
      "answerEng": "Answer: C\n    GDP at factor cost = Private consumption expenditure + Gross investment + Government consumption\n    expenditure + Net exports–Indirect taxes + Subsidies\n    1,400 = 500 + (220 + 80 – 10) + 500 + (280 – 100 – 60) – X + 50\n    X = 60",
      "originalAnswerImageEng": "originals/37/ae-p1-24.jpg",
      "originalQuestionImageEng": "originals/37/qe-p1-24.jpg",
