      "inlineDiagrams": "diagrams/MT37-P1-37.jpg",
      "questionTextEng": "The following diagram shows the relationship between taxable income and tax payment in a tax system.\n\n                           Tax payment\n\n                              0                                           Taxable income\n\n    Which of the following statements about the above tax system is/are CORRECT?\n\n            (1)   It is a regressive tax.\n            (2)   It will result in a more even income distribution.\n            (3)   A tax allowance may be provided for the tax.\n\n            A.    (1) only\n            B.    (2) only\n            C.    (1) and (3) only\n            D.    (2) and (3) only",
