      "questionTextEng": "If the government raises the standard rate of salaries tax, the output level ____________, and the government’s tax\n    revenue from salaries tax ____________.\n\n            A.    will decrease ... may increase or decrease\n            B.    will decrease ... will increase\n            C.    may increase or decrease ... may increase or decrease\n            D.    may increase or decrease ... will decrease",
