      "questionTextEng": "Refer to the following data for Country A.\n\n                                                                                   Year                   Real GDP       Unemployment rate\n                                                                                   2021                   9,500,000           4.2%\n                                                                                   2022                   8,100,000           4.4%\n                                                                                   2023                   7,005,000           4.5%\n\n                                                           (a)   The economy of Country A was most likely in which phase of the business cycle during 2021 to 2023?\n                                                                                                                                                           (1 mark)\n\n                                                           (b)   Give TWO reasons why we cannot conclude from the above data that the living standard of the\n                                                                 people in Country A decreased during the above period.                                   (2 marks)\n\n                                                           (c)   ‘The above change in the unemployment rate necessarily implies an increase in the unemployed\n\n                                                                 population in Country A between 2021 and 2023.’ Do you agree? Explain your answer.       (4 marks)",
