      "questionTextEng": "The Hong Kong SAR Government announced that it would expand the list of eligible universities under the Top\n      Talent Pass Scheme (TTPS) and extend the validity period of the first visas from two years to three years to attract\n      more talent to come to Hong Kong for development.\n\n      The above measure will lead to\n\n            (1)   an increase in the geographical mobility of labour in Hong Kong.\n            (2)   an increase in Hong Kong’s average labour productivity.\n            (3)   an increase in Hong Kong’s labour supply.\n\n            A.    (1) and (2) only\n            B.    (1) and (3) only\n            C.    (2) and (3) only\n            D.    (1), (2) and (3)",
      "answerEng": "Answer: C\n    (1) is incorrect. Expanding the list of eligible universities under the TTPS will increase the geographical\n     mobility of people coming to Hong Kong for development, while the geographical mobility of Hong\n    Kong workers will not be affected.",
