      "questionTextEng": "A Hong Kong chain fashion store acquired an Indonesian garment factory.\n\n      Which of the following is the LEAST likely motive for the above acquisition?\n\n            A.    to enhance its corporate image\n            B.    to enjoy economies of scale\n            C.    to ensure a reliable supply of input\n            D.    to develop sales channels for its products",
