      "source": "模擬試卷三十八 卷一",
      "reviewedByAI": "Y",
      "lastReviewDate": "2026-09-24",
      "originalQuestionImage": "originals/38/q-p1-23.jpg",
      "originalAnswerImage": "originals/38/a-p1-23.jpg",
      "questionTextEng": "The government of Country A imposes a quota limit on imported textiles to protect the local textile industry.\n      Which of the following statements is CORRECT?\n\n            A.    The total wage earnings of workers in the local textile industry will increase.\n            B.    Country A’s demand for imported textiles will decrease.\n            C.    The supply of textiles in Country A will increase.\n            D.    If the demand for imported textiles is inelastic, consumers’ expenditure on imported textiles will\n                  decrease.",
      "answerEng": "Answer: A\n    Local textiles and imported textiles are substitutes. Imposing a quota on imported textiles will lead to an\n    increase in the price of imported textiles, so demand for local textiles will increase. Since demand for\n    workers in the textile industry is a derived demand for textiles, the demand for workers in the local\n    textile industry will increase and the total wage earnings of workers in the local textile industry will\n    increase.\n    Option B is incorrect. The import quota will lead to a higher price of imported textiles. According to the\n    law of demand, the quantity demanded of imported textiles will decrease, not the demand.\n    Option C is incorrect. Imposing a quota on imported textiles will not increase the supply of Country A’s\n    textiles.\n    Option D is incorrect. Imposing a quota on imported textiles will lead to an increase in the price of\n    imported textiles and a decrease in the quantity transacted. If the demand for imported textiles is\n    inelastic, the percentage decrease in quantity transacted will be smaller than the percentage increase in\n    price, and total expenditure will increase.",
      "originalAnswerImageEng": "originals/38/ae-p1-23.jpg",
      "originalQuestionImageEng": "originals/38/qe-p1-23.jpg",
      "stemPatterns": [
        "（進口配額）下列哪項描述是正確的？"
      ]
