      "questionTextEng": "To encourage the public to receive the seasonal influenza vaccination, the government provides a free\n                                                           vaccination service to eligible persons, including seniors aged 50 and above, pregnant women and children.\n\n                                                           (a)   Explain whether the free vaccination service is a free good.                                (2 marks)\n\n                                                           (b)   A doctor suggests that the government extend the free seasonal influenza vaccination service to all\n                                                                 individuals willing to be vaccinated. In terms of externality, explain how the suggestion could improve\n                                                                 economic efficiency.                                                                          (4 marks)\n\n                                                           (c)   ‘Providing more vaccination services can reduce government expenditure on public health.’ Explain\n                                                                 whether this is a positive statement or a normative statement.                            (2 marks)",
