      "questionTextEng": "In which of the following situations may the fiscal balance and the trade balance be improved at the same time?\n\n           A.         The government chooses to buy more locally produced goods rather than imported goods.\n           B.         The central bank lowers the discount rate.\n           C.         The government increases the business registration fee.\n           D.         The government reduces the unemployment benefits.",
