      "questionTextEng": "SmartNet is the only mobile network service provider in Country A and it adopts uniform pricing. Figure 2\n                                                           shows its demand curve and marginal cost curve.\n\n                                                                                       Figure 2\n\n                                                                       Unit price\n                                                                                                                        MC0: marginal cost\n                                                                                                                        D0: demand\n\n                                                                                                             MC0\n\n                                                                                                        D0\n                                                                         0                                         Quantity\n\n                                                           (a)   Indicate the profit-maximising output and price as QM and PM respectively in Figure 2.      (2 marks)\n\n                                                           (b)   Indicate the deadweight loss caused by SmartNet adopting uniform pricing in Figure 2.        (1 mark)\n\n                                                           (c)   Suppose the cost per user of providing mobile network services decreases due to technological\n                                                                 improvement, while SmartNet does not change its output and price. With the aid of Figure 2, explain\n                                                                 whether economic efficiency would be affected.                                             (4 marks)\n\n                                                           (d)   Explain whether the following pricing arrangements of SmartNet constitute price discrimination.\n\n                                                                 (i)    Customers with high data usage pay a lower price per unit of data than customers with low data\n                                                                        usage.                                                                                (3 marks)\n\n                                                                 (ii) New customers are charged a lower price than existing customers.                       (3 marks)\n\n                                                           (e)   SmartNet requires customers to subscribe to its streaming movie service when purchasing mobile\n                                                                 network services.\n\n                                                                 (i)    Name the anti-competitive behaviour that SmartNet may engage in.                      (1 mark)\n\n                                                                 (ii) If the above case occurred in Hong Kong, which conduct rule of the Competition Ordinance of\n                                                                      Hong Kong might SmartNet violated? Explain.                                         (2 marks)",
