      "questionTextEng": "Lyndon is considering what career to pursue after graduating from university. He is considering becoming a\n     fencing coach or a civil servant. Which of the following would be the LEAST important factor for Lyndon in\n     choosing whether to become a fencing coach or a civil servant?\n\n           A.     The government increases benefits for civil servants.\n           B.     Many schools are establishing fencing teams and hiring fencing coaches.\n           C.     The income of a fencing coach is lower than Lyndon expected.\n           D.     Lyndon had already obtained the qualification of a fencing coach when he was in university.",
