      "answerEng": "Answer: D\n     (1) is correct. Employees have the exclusive right to use their own lockers because they have the right to\n     decide how to use their own lockers, such as what to put in them.\n     (2) is correct. To the company, the employees’ lockers are goods used in the production process to\n     produce other goods and services.\n     (3) is correct. An employee’s locker is a private good because when a locker is occupied, the number of\n     lockers available for others to use decreases.",
