      "questionTextEng": "The supply curve for good X is upward sloping, and its demand is perfectly inelastic.\n\n      If the production cost of good X decreases, and the price of the substitute for good X increases, the equilibrium\n      price of good X __________ and its equilibrium quantity __________.\n\n            A.    will decrease ... will decrease\n            B.    may increase, decrease or remain unchanged ... will decrease\n            C.    will increase ... will increase\n            D.    may increase, decrease or remain unchanged ... will increase",
