      "questionTextEng": "Given that the price elasticity of supply of cakes is 0.5. When the price of cakes increases,\n\n            A.    the demand for cakes will decrease.\n            B.    the quantity supplied of cakes will decrease.\n            C.    the quantity supplied of cakes will change by the same percentage.\n            D.    the quantity supplied of cakes will increase, while the percentage increase will be smaller than the\n                  percentage increase in price.",
      "answerEng": "Answer: D\n    When the value of elasticity of supply is greater than 0 but smaller than 1, the supply of cake is inelastic,\n    which means that the percentage change in quantity supplied due to a change in price is smaller than the\n    percentage change in price.",
