      "questionTextEng": "Kiff and Joey jointly operate a noodle shop, and they bear unlimited liability.\n\n                                                           (a)   Define ‘unlimited liability’.                                                                (2 marks)\n\n                                                           (b)   What type of business ownership does the above firm belong to? Other than unlimited liability, list\n                                                                 TWO other features of this type of business ownership.                                     (3 marks)\n\n                                                           (c)   Later, Kiff and Joey do not want to bear unlimited liability and want to change the company’s type of\n                                                                 ownership. Explain what type of ownership you would recommend they change to in each of the\n                                                                 following situations.\n\n                                                                 (i)   They want the ownership of the firm to be easily transferable.                          (2 marks)\n\n                                                                 (ii) They want the accounting information to be kept confidential.                            (2 marks)\n\n                                                     .",
