      "questionTextEng": "The Hong Kong Fire Services Department is a public enterprise that provides firefighting, rescue, fire\n                                                           prevention and ambulance services to the public.\n\n                                                          (a)   Give TWO advantages of providing the above services by a public enterprise instead of a private\n                                                                enterprise.                                                                           (2 marks)\n\n                                                           The Hong Kong Fire Services Department will hold free open days for the public. Activities include booth\n                                                           games, firefighting and rescue demonstrations, and exhibitions, aimed at enhancing the public’s awareness\n                                                           of fire safety.\n\n                                                          (b) Explain whether the booth games in the open day are public goods.                                (3 marks)\n\n                                                           Miss Wong, a resident who participated in the open day, said, ‘The open day attracts many residents each\n                                                           time, and sometimes you have to wait to participate in the activities.’\n\n                                                          (c)   Explain whether the above statement is a positive statement or a normative statement.          (2 marks)\n\n                                                          (d) Explain whether Miss Wong’s opportunity cost of participating in the open day would change under the\n                                                              following situations:\n\n                                                                 (i)   On the day of the open day, it rained heavily, causing Miss Wong to feel unwell and need\n                                                                       medical treatment.                                                                     (2 marks)\n\n                                                                 (ii) The activities on the open day were more interesting than Miss Wong expected.           (2 marks)",
