      "questionTextEng": "Baidu Baike (百度百科) is an online encyclopedia. The knowledge on Baidu Baike is\n     _________________________.\n\n           A.    a private good because Baidu Baike is run by a private enterprise\n           B.    a free good because people do not have to pay to obtain the knowledge\n           C.    a capital in Economics because people are willing to pay for the knowledge\n           D.    a public good because a person’s consumption does not reduce the amount available to others",
