      "answerEng": "Answer: B\n    (1) is not included in the calculation of the GDP in 2025. The Old Age Living Allowance is a transfer\n    payment with no corresponding production.\n    (3) is not included in the calculation of the GDP in 2025. The pocket money does not involve\n    production.\n    (2) is included in the calculation of the GDP in 2025. The expenditure is regarded as consumption\n    expenditure by a household on final goods and services.",
