      "questionTextEng": "Mr. Tai withdrew HK$100,000 cash from a demand deposit with a licensed bank. He then deposited HK$50,000\n      of the amount into a time deposit with the same bank and remitted the remainder overseas.\n\n      What will be the immediate effect of the above actions on the money supply of Hong Kong?\n\n           A.    Money supply M1 will decrease by HK$100,000.\n           B.    Both money supply M1 and money supply M2 will decrease by HK$50,000.\n           C.    Money supply M3 will remain unchanged.\n           D.    Money supply M1, money supply M2 and money supply M3 will decrease by HK$50,000.",
