      "questionTextEng": "GreenLife is a company that produces organic food. Recently, it acquired two companies as illustrated in the\n    following diagram:\n\n                                                       GreenLife\n\n                                          X                                  Y\n\n                                   Full Organic Farm               Lively Beverage\n                                                                      Company\n\n     Full Organic Farm is a farm that provides organic ingredients while Lively Beverage Company is a health\n     beverage company. To GreenLife, the types of integration shown by X and Y are __________ integration and\n     __________ integration respectively.\n\n           A.    vertical backward ... lateral\n           B.    vertical backward ... vertical forward\n           C.    lateral ... vertical forward\n           D.    lateral ... lateral",
