      "lastReviewDate": "2026-09-24",
      "originalQuestionImage": "originals/42/q-p1-21.jpg",
      "originalAnswerImage": "originals/42/a-p1-21.jpg",
      "questionTextEng": "Which of the following is an example of a divergence between private and social benefits?\n\n            A.     A coffee shop customer uses the free Wi-Fi in the shop to browse social media.\n            B.     A resident was annoyed by pollution caused by feral pigeons. After the government strengthened the\n                   enforcement of the ban on feeding feral pigeons, the pollution issue improved.\n            C.     A passerby enjoys a free street art performance in the West Kowloon Cultural District without making\n                   a donation.\n            D.     A university student improves his academic performance after reading books borrowed from the\n                   university library.",
      "answerEng": "Answer: C\n    Since the passer-by enjoyed the performance without compensating the performers, the performers\n    brought external benefits to the passersby, which is an example of divergence between private and social\n    benefits.\n    Option A is incorrect. When a customer decides whether to visit a coffee shop, he considers the services\n    provided by the coffee shop (such as free Wi-Fi), and the benefits provided by these services are\n    internalised.\n\n    Option B is incorrect. Initially, those who fed feral pigeons affected the resident’s living without\n    providing any compensation. External cost existed. However, after the government strengthened the\n    enforcement of the ban on feeding feral pigeons, the pollution problem improved, reducing the\n    divergence between private and social costs. This example did not result in a divergence between private\n    and social benefits.\n    Option D is incorrect. When a student decides whether to enroll in a university, he considers the services\n    provided by the university (such as the services of the university library). The tuition includes his right\n    to use the services, and the benefits provided by the services are internalised.",
      "originalAnswerImageEng": "originals/42/ae-p1-21.jpg",
      "originalQuestionImageEng": "originals/42/qe-p1-21.jpg",
      "stemPatterns": [
        "下列哪項是私人利益和社會利益分歧的例子？"
      ]
