      "questionTextEng": "A major economic crisis in Country A has led to a significant depreciation of its currency. As a result, people have\n    started bartering or trading using US dollars. Many people withdraw their bank deposits and convert them into US\n    dollars. Which of the following statements are CORRECT?\n\n            (1)      The function of Country A’s currency as a medium of exchange is weakened.\n            (2)      The US dollar serves the function of money as a store of value.\n            (3)      The US dollar is the legal tender of Country A.\n\n            A.       (1) and (2) only\n            B.       (1) and (3) only\n            C.       (2) and (3) only\n            D.       (1), (2) and (3)",
