      "questionTextEng": "If the government of a country increases taxes on households to fund its expenditure, and the increase in taxes\n    equals the increase in government expenditure, the aggregate demand of the country _________.\n\n              A.       will increase\n              B.       will decrease\n              C.       will remain unchanged\n              D.       may increase, decrease or remain unchanged",
