      "questionTextEng": "Refer to the following information about the balance of payments of an economy in a certain year.\n\n                    10,000\n                      8,000\n                      6,000\n                      4,000\n                      2,000\n                          0\n                     -2,000\n                     -4,000\n                     -6,000\n                                            2023                                  2024\n                                                   Balance of trade in goods\n                                                   Balance of trade in services\n\n    According to the above information, we can conclude that\n\n           A.    there was a current account surplus in 2023 and a current account deficit in 2024.\n           B.    exports of goods in 2024 were lower than those in 2023.\n           C.    imports of goods in 2024 were higher than those in 2023.\n           D.    exports of services were smaller than imports of services in both 2023 and 2024.",
