      "questionTextEng": "Country A has been experiencing a fiscal deficit in recent years, and improving its fiscal situation has\n                                                           become a matter of public concern.\n\n                                                          (a)   Explain whether a general sales tax is a direct tax or an indirect tax.                          (2 marks)\n\n                                                          (b) Compared with raising the standard rate of the salaries tax, discuss ONE advantage and ONE\n                                                              disadvantage of imposing a general sales tax.                                       (4 marks)\n\n                                                          (c)   Suppose Country A initially has a deflationary (output) gap. With the aid of an AS-AD diagram, explain\n                                                                how the imposition of a general sales tax will affect the gap in the short run.              (6 marks)\n\n                                                          (d) Suggest and explain ONE monetary policy that would improve Country A’s fiscal deficit without\n                                                              causing a decline in aggregate output.                                              (4 marks)",
