      "questionTextEng": "Real-name registration system is adopted for the sale of the tickets and the tickets are non-transferable.\n\n     Which of the following statements about the above ticket sales arrangement is/are CORRECT?\n\n           (1)   The above rules are related to the problem of ‘for whom to produce’.\n           (2)   The right to transfer over the tickets would be weakened.\n           (3)   Price competition would not be involved in the allocation of the tickets.\n\n           A.    (1) only\n           B.    (2) only\n           C.    (1) and (2) only\n           D.    (2) and (3) only",
