      "questionTextEng": "An automobile manufacturer acquires an engine manufacturer. The engine manufacturer has a number of clients,\n      and its engines can be used in cars of different brands. Which of the following could be the motives behind the\n      acquisition?\n\n            (1)   to enjoy economies of scale\n            (2)   to diversify risk through business diversification\n            (3)   to expand the market outlet for its products\n\n            A.    (1) and (2) only\n            B.    (1) and (3) only\n            C.    (2) and (3) only\n            D.    (1), (2) and (3)",
