      "questionTextEng": "Country A has many banks providing loan services.\n\n                                                          Source A: Loan amounts of the three largest banks in Country A from 2023 to 2025\n\n                                                                             60\n\n                                                                             50\n\n                                                                             40\n                                                                ($billion)\n\n                                                                             30\n\n                                                                             20\n\n                                                                             10\n\n                                                                             0\n                                                                                     2023                    2024                    2025\n\n                                                                                        Bank A    Bank B    Bank C    Other banks\n\n                                                          Source B: A news report about an acquisition made by a bank\n\n                                                           Bank A proposes to acquire a credit reporting agency. A credit reporting agency is an institution that\n                                                           specialises in collecting, organising and providing credit reports of borrowers to banks. It helps\n                                                           banks assess loan risks, decide whether to grant loans and determine the interest rates for loans, etc.\n\n                                                          (a)         Refer to Source A. Which type of market structure is the bank loan services market in Country A most\n                                                                      likely to belong to? State TWO features of this type of market structure.                   (3 marks)\n\n                                                          (b) Suppose the government of Country A issues more licenses, allowing more finance companies to\n                                                              participate in the loan business. Explain how this would affect the price elasticity of demand for bank\n                                                              loan services.                                                                                (3 marks)\n\n                                                          (c)         Refer to Source B. Explain which type of integration this acquisition belongs to and state TWO possible\n                                                                      motives for this type of integration.                                                         (4 marks)",
