      "questionTextEng": "A luxury brand launches a limited-edition watch. Some fans of the brand are willing to pay the listed price and\n    spend time queuing, but they still find that the watches are sold out.\n\n     From the information above, we can infer that the quantity transacted of the watches is __________.\n\n            A.    equal to the quantity supplied and smaller than the quantity demanded\n            B.    equal to the quantity supplied and larger than the quantity demanded\n            C.    equal to the quantity demanded and smaller than the quantity supplied\n            D.    equal to the quantity demanded and larger than the quantity supplied",
      "answerEng": "Answer: A\n    There is excess demand for the limited-edition watches (quantity demanded exceeds quantity supplied).\n    Therefore, the quantity transacted will equal the quantity supplied and will be smaller than the quantity\n    demanded.",
