      "questionTextEng": "Refer to the following supply-demand diagram for bus services in Country A. The initial equilibrium point is E₀.\n\n                         Fare\n                                                      S2\n                                                              S0\n                                             E1\n                                                                   S1\n\n                                     E2      E0          E4\n\n                                            E3                     D1\n                                                              D0\n                                                    D2\n                         0                                          Quantity\n\n     Suppose the salaries of bus drivers generally fall, and at the same time, a new railway branch line officially opens\n     and covers the operating area of the bus services. The new equilibrium point will be ___________.\n\n            A.    E1\n            B.    E2\n            C.    E3\n            D.    E4",
