      "questionTextEng": "Refer to the following demand-supply diagram for good X. Initially, the quota is set at Q1.\n\n                                  Unit price\n                                          SQ1         SQ2            S\n\n                                                  a        b\n                                      P0                                      D\n\n                                                      c\n\n                                            e\n\n                                       0                                       Quantity\n                                             Q1           Q2\n\n      The government adjusts the quota of good X from Q 1 to Q2. Which of the following statements about good X are\n      CORRECT?\n\n            (1)   Consumer surplus increases.\n            (2)   Total social surplus increases by the area abce.\n            (3)   Consumers’ total expenditure on good X increases by area abQ2Q1.\n\n            A.    (1) and (2) only\n            B.    (1) and (3) only\n            C.    (2) and (3) only\n            D.    (1), (2) and (3)",
      "answerEng": "Answer: C\n    When the government adjusts the quota of good X from Q1 to Q2, the quantity transacted increases from\n    Q1 to Q2, while the price remains at P0.\n    (2) is correct. The original total social surplus is the area P0aef, and the new total social surplus is the\n    area P0bcf, which is an increase by the area abce.\n    (3) is correct. The original total expenditure is the area P0aQ10, and the new total expenditure is the area\n    P0bQ20, which is an increase by the area abQ2Q1.\n    (1) is incorrect. Consumer surplus is zero both before and after the quota increase, so consumer surplus\n    has not increased.\n\n                              Unit price\n                                      SQ1 SQ2                 S\n\n                                          a       b                   D\n                                P0\n\n                                              c\n                                      e\n                                 f\n                                 0                                     Quantity\n                                      Q1      Q2",
      "originalAnswerImageEng": "originals/44/ae-p1-21.jpg",
      "originalQuestionImageEng": "originals/44/qe-p1-21.jpg",
      "stemPatterns": [
        "（配額供需圖）配額調整，下列哪些陳述正確？"
      ]
