      "questionTextEng": "If there is unexpected inflation, which of the following persons will gain?\n\n             A.    a businessman who holds a time deposit in a bank\n             B.    a secondary school student who keeps red packet money at home\n             C.    an investor who rents out a residential unit at a fixed rent\n             D.    a consumer who pays a fixed monthly fee for a video streaming service",
