      "questionTextEng": "The following is a conversation between Yanny and Vincent.\n\n                                                            Vincent: You need to repay me $200 today.\n                                                            Yanny: I don’t have cash right now. Can I repay you with ten $20 ice cream shop cash coupons\n                                                                     instead?\n                                                            Vincent: No, I only accept cash repayment. If you buy me an ice cream, I can let you to repay me\n                                                                     next month.\n                                                            Yanny: Okay. I’ll buy you a cup of chocolate ice cream.\n\n                                                           (a)   Give TWO reasons to explain why Vincent only accepts cash repayment and refuses to accept the\n                                                                 cash coupons as repayment.                                                              (4 marks)\n\n                                                           (b)   Explain why the cup of chocolate ice cream can be regarded as interest to Yanny.          (2 marks)",
