      "questionTextEng": "A small open economy imports disposable plastic tableware from other countries. Suppose more people in\n                                                           the economy use takeaway services. At the same time, the government decides to impose a tariff on imported\n                                                           disposable plastic tableware to reduce its consumption.\n\n                                                                                   Figure 1\n                                                                Price\n                                                                                                                S0: Domestic supply of disposable plastic tableware\n\n                                                                                                      S0        D0: Domestic demand for disposable plastic tableware\n                                                                                                                P w : International price of disposable plastic tableware\n\n                                                               Pw\n\n                                                                                                           D0\n                                                                0                                                      Quantity\n\n                                                            Suppose the final quantity transacted of disposable plastic tableware decreases. Indicate, in Figure 1, the\n                                                            import volume of disposable plastic tableware with more people using takeaway services and the tariff in\n                                                            effect.                                                                                           (3 marks)",
