      "questionTextEng": "Under the linked exchange rate system of Hong Kong, which of the following statements is correct?\n\nA. The money supply M1 of Hong Kong has to be fully backed up by the US dollar.\nB. Hong Kong's export volume will increase when the US dollar depreciates against other currencies.\nC. The market exchange rate of the HK dollar relative to the US dollar is fixed.\nD. Hong Kong citizens can sell USD to the three note-issuing banks for 7.8HKD.",
