      "questionTextEng": "The table below shows Hong Kong's employment data between May and July, 2024.\n\tNumber of persons\nEmployed persons\t3 708 600\t\nUnemployed persons\t117 800\t\nUnderemployed persons\t47 500\t\n(a)\tCalculate the unemployment rate in the above period. Show your workings\t(2 marks)\n(b)\tState TWO losses to society caused by unemployment\t(2 marks)",
